{"slug":"kh-r-j","ar":"خ ر ج","total":182,"core":"going out; bringing out","forms":[{"ar":"أَخْرَجَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":99,"gloss":"To bring out, bring forth","word":"akhraja","ex":{"s":87,"a":4,"p":2,"ar":["وَٱلَّذِىٓ","أَخْرَجَ","ٱلْمَرْعَىٰ"],"en":"And who brings out the pasture"}},{"ar":"خَرَجَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":53,"gloss":"to go out, come out","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":22,"p":1,"ar":["يَخْرُجُ","مِنْهُمَا","ٱللُّؤْلُؤُ","وَٱلْمَرْجَانُ"],"en":"From both of them emerge pearl and coral"}},{"ar":"إِخْرَاج","kind":"verbal noun","form":4,"count":6,"gloss":"bringing out; expulsion","word":null,"ex":{"s":71,"a":18,"p":5,"ar":["ثُمَّ","يُعِيدُكُمْ","فِيهَا","وَيُخْرِجُكُمْ","إِخْرَاجًا"],"en":"Then He will return you into it and extract you [another] extraction"}},{"ar":"مُخْرَج","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":5,"gloss":"brought out; exit","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":48,"p":8,"ar":["لَا","يَمَسُّهُمْ","فِيهَا","نَصَبٌ","وَمَا","هُم","مِّنْهَا","بِمُخْرَجِينَ"],"en":"No fatigue will touch them therein, nor from it will they [ever] be removed"}},{"ar":"خُرُوج","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"coming out, emergence","word":null,"ex":{"s":50,"a":42,"p":7,"ar":["يَوْمَ","يَسْمَعُونَ","ٱلصَّيْحَةَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","ذَٰلِكَ","يَوْمُ","ٱلْخُرُوجِ"],"en":"The Day they will hear the blast [of the Horn] in truth. That is the Day of Emergence [from the graves]"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَخْرَجَ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":4,"gloss":"to extract, bring out","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":14,"p":9,"ar":["وَهُوَ","ٱلَّذِى","سَخَّرَ","ٱلْبَحْرَ","لِتَأْكُلُوا۟","مِنْهُ","لَحْمًا","طَرِيًّا","وَتَسْتَخْرِجُوا۟","مِنْهُ","حِلْيَةً","تَلْبَسُونَهَا","وَتَرَى","ٱلْفُلْكَ","مَوَاخِرَ","فِيهِ","وَلِتَبْتَغُوا۟","مِن","فَضْلِهِۦ","وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","تَشْكُرُونَ"],"en":"And it is He who subjected the sea for you to eat from it tender meat and to extract from it ornaments which you wear. And you see the ships plowing through it, and [He subjected it] that you may seek of His bounty; and perhaps you will be grateful"}},{"ar":"مُخْرِج","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"bringer forth","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":72,"p":7,"ar":["وَإِذْ","قَتَلْتُمْ","نَفْسًا","فَٱدَّٰرَْٰٔتُمْ","فِيهَا ۖ","وَٱللَّهُ","مُخْرِجٌ","مَّا","كُنتُمْ","تَكْتُمُونَ"],"en":"And [recall] when you slew a man and disputed over it, but Allah was to bring out that which you were concealing"}},{"ar":"خَارِج","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"coming out","word":null,"ex":{"s":5,"a":37,"p":8,"ar":["يُرِيدُونَ","أَن","يَخْرُجُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلنَّارِ","وَمَا","هُم","بِخَـٰرِجِينَ","مِنْهَا ۖ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","مُّقِيمٌ"],"en":"They will wish to get out of the Fire, but never are they to emerge therefrom, and for them is an enduring punishment"}},{"ar":"خَرْج","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"payment, tribute","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":72,"p":3,"ar":["أَمْ","تَسْـَٔلُهُمْ","خَرْجًا","فَخَرَاجُ","رَبِّكَ","خَيْرٌ ۖ","وَهُوَ","خَيْرُ","ٱلرَّٰزِقِينَ"],"en":"Or do you, [O Muhammad], ask them for payment? But the reward of your Lord is best, and He is the best of providers"}},{"ar":"مَخْرَج","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"way out","word":null,"ex":{"s":65,"a":2,"p":30,"ar":["فَإِذَا","بَلَغْنَ","أَجَلَهُنَّ","فَأَمْسِكُوهُنَّ","بِمَعْرُوفٍ","أَوْ","فَارِقُوهُنَّ","بِمَعْرُوفٍ","وَأَشْهِدُوا۟","ذَوَىْ","عَدْلٍ","مِّنكُمْ","وَأَقِيمُوا۟","ٱلشَّهَـٰدَةَ","لِلَّهِ ۚ","ذَٰلِكُمْ","يُوعَظُ","بِهِۦ","مَن","كَانَ","يُؤْمِنُ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۚ","وَمَن","يَتَّقِ","ٱللَّهَ","يَجْعَل","لَّهُۥ","مَخْرَجًا"],"en":"And when they have [nearly] fulfilled their term, either retain them according to acceptable terms or part with them according to acceptable terms. And bring to witness two just men from among you and establish the testimony for [the acceptance of] Allah. That is instructed to whoever should believe in Allah and the Last day. And whoever fears Allah - He will make 